p.src:
We can keep the contrast visible: $\text{fragmentary action}
\neq
\text{whole action}.$ Fragmentary action proceeds from division, authority, image, imitation, dependency, or accumulated knowledge. Whole action is not an occasional response in crisis. It must operate in daily life, every minute, in relationship, thought, speech, and conduct.

