p.src:
The sequence is $\text{knowledge}
\;\longrightarrow\;
\text{image}
\;\longrightarrow\;
\text{observer}
\;\longrightarrow\;
\text{separation}.$ The important step is the third one: the image becomes the observer. The observer is not a pure witness outside conditioning. It is built from memory, judgement, naming, hurt, flattery, insult, belief, fear, and desire.

