p.src:
Suppose someone flatters us or insults us. If the words are accumulated, the update is $\begin{aligned}
I_{n+1}
&= I_n \cup \{\text{flattery}\}
&&\Longrightarrow\quad \text{the speaker becomes friend},\\
I_{n+1}
&= I_n \cup \{\text{insult}\}
&&\Longrightarrow\quad \text{the speaker becomes enemy}.\end{aligned}$ In either case, listening has created an image. The image separates. From then on one no longer listens directly; one listens through the stored picture.

